<h1>NFL Roster Cuts 2026: The <em>Combine Numbers</em> Behind the Bubble</h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>✂️ Roster Cuts 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Every team trims to 53 players by 6 p.m. ET on Sunday, August 30 — a leaguewide purge that will release roughly 1,184 players in a single weekend. Roster spots get decided by scheme fit, contract numbers, and coaching preference, but the testing data measured at the combine still tells part of the story. Here's what the numbers say about five notable names currently on the bubble.</p>
